00:11:33.314 --> 00:11:34.951
- [Voiceover] James asks,
"How would you deal with

00:11:34.951 --> 00:11:38.521
"a cofounder who isn't
as ambitious as you?"

00:11:38.521 --> 00:11:40.248
- I'd break up with them.

00:11:40.248 --> 00:11:41.877
I think that if you 
have a cofounder

00:11:41.877 --> 00:11:44.249
that's not as 
ambitious as you are,

00:11:44.249 --> 00:11:46.524
you're leaning to 
an inevitable breakup

00:11:46.524 --> 00:11:48.966
and I would try 
to cut it earlier

00:11:48.966 --> 00:11:51.526
so that feelings aren't as deep.

00:11:51.526 --> 00:11:53.960
It's easier to break up with
somebody after three weeks

00:11:53.960 --> 00:11:55.233
than it is after three months

00:11:55.233 --> 00:11:57.266
than it is after 
three years, right?

00:11:57.266 --> 00:11:59.220
And so there's less baggage.

00:11:59.220 --> 00:12:02.559
Now, the cofounder may be so
talented and brings you value

00:12:02.559 --> 00:12:05.246
that maybe you don't have
to judge them on ambition.

00:12:05.246 --> 00:12:07.506
But I would say that when
you and your cofounder

00:12:07.506 --> 00:12:09.057
are not aligned,

00:12:10.257 --> 00:12:13.267
you're headed towards a negative

00:12:13.267 --> 00:12:15.751
and so, I would 
communicate first.

00:12:15.751 --> 00:12:17.459
I'm giving you the finish line
but what I would start with

00:12:17.459 --> 00:12:20.024
is I'd be like, "Hey India,
can we have a coffee?"

00:12:20.024 --> 00:12:20.967
- Sure, yeah.

00:12:20.967 --> 00:12:23.248
- So, listen, I really think
- [India] (laughs)

00:12:23.248 --> 00:12:25.284
- that I have bigger
ambitions for this business

00:12:25.284 --> 00:12:27.485
than you do and I'd like
to talk to you about that.

00:12:27.485 --> 00:12:28.375
- That's probably true.

00:12:28.375 --> 00:12:30.125
- Yeah, it's definitely true.
- [India] (laughs)

00:12:30.125 --> 00:12:31.674
- And so, I think you
have that conversation.

00:12:31.674 --> 00:12:32.897
One of the things 
that it's led to,

00:12:32.897 --> 00:12:34.163
and I've given 
this advice a lot,

00:12:34.163 --> 00:12:36.120
is that India and I who
started off at 50/50,

00:12:36.120 --> 00:12:38.359
India recognizes that and
sees that I'm putting in

00:12:38.359 --> 00:12:40.800
18 hours a day and 
she's putting in seven.

00:12:40.800 --> 00:12:42.300
And she may say, "You know what,

00:12:42.300 --> 00:12:43.716
"I still want to 
ride that train.

00:12:43.716 --> 00:12:46.848
"I believe in us, I can't do
that, I'm not as ambitious,

00:12:46.848 --> 00:12:49.297
"I don't have as much
energy, I don't want to,

00:12:49.297 --> 00:12:51.453
"I have things at home 
that I want to do,

00:12:51.453 --> 00:12:52.469
"dah dah dah dah dah.

00:12:52.469 --> 00:12:54.263
"Maybe I should give 
you back and now,

00:12:54.263 --> 00:12:56.305
you have 70% and I have 30."

00:12:56.305 --> 00:12:59.272
And so really, there's
always a deal to be had.

00:12:59.272 --> 00:13:01.675
If the deal ends 
up being 100/zero

00:13:01.675 --> 00:13:04.284
'cause I don't value India,
even at 30, or even at 20,

00:13:04.284 --> 00:13:06.231
or even at 10, or even at zero,

00:13:06.231 --> 00:13:07.745
well then you have to break up.

00:13:07.745 --> 00:13:11.038
But everything in life,
every relationship, you know,

00:13:11.038 --> 00:13:15.033
boss and employee,
boyfriend and girlfriend,

00:13:15.033 --> 00:13:18.976
partners in business,
cousins, Mom and Dad,

00:13:18.976 --> 00:13:22.679
every relationship on Earth
is predicated on communication

00:13:22.679 --> 00:13:26.259
and you have to have the

00:13:26.259 --> 00:13:29.683
backbone to step up and
actually have that conversation

00:13:29.683 --> 00:13:31.680
and have it in 
a truthful manner.

00:13:31.680 --> 00:13:34.283
And it's super scary 
and a lot of people

00:13:34.283 --> 00:13:35.544
are intimidated by it.

00:13:35.544 --> 00:13:37.735
And I'm not, it took me a
long time to get good at it.

00:13:37.735 --> 00:13:40.840
I still don't always 
get great at it but,

00:13:40.840 --> 00:13:42.954
it is the only answer 
to this question.

00:13:42.954 --> 00:13:44.784
It's about having the
conversation and seeing

00:13:44.784 --> 00:13:47.969
where the things fall
because a lot of times,

00:13:47.969 --> 00:13:50.344
the other person doesn't
want you to bring it up.

00:13:50.344 --> 00:13:52.130
They may, you know, 
recognize it.

00:13:52.130 --> 00:13:53.512
Sometimes they 
don't even recognize it.

00:13:53.512 --> 00:13:56.070
Some people are blind
and lack self-awareness.

00:13:56.070 --> 00:13:58.184
So, you need to make 
sure you're connected

00:13:58.184 --> 00:14:00.705
in whatever that arrangement is.

00:14:01.915 --> 00:14:02.819
- [India] Now's one from Sarah.

00:14:02.819 --> 00:14:03.918
- Sarah.

