00:14:07.162 --> 00:14:09.677
- Hey Gary Vee, I wanna 
ask you a question

00:14:09.677 --> 00:14:12.033
about competition.
- Yes, I love competition.

00:14:12.033 --> 00:14:14.462
- A lot of solopeneurs
are advised that

00:14:14.462 --> 00:14:16.745
don't look at the competition
because it can drain you

00:14:16.745 --> 00:14:18.741
and make you 
second-guess yourself and

00:14:18.741 --> 00:14:20.126
everything like that 
but I, you know,

00:14:20.126 --> 00:14:21.716
through my business
that is and things like that

00:14:21.716 --> 00:14:24.762
I've realized that, 
or I've been taught

00:14:24.762 --> 00:14:28.389
that you can't operate
in a silo, you know.

00:14:28.389 --> 00:14:30.588
Your landscape, you
have to keep your eye on

00:14:30.588 --> 00:14:32.092
the landscape of your industry.

00:14:32.092 --> 00:14:36.506
So, my question is, 
what do you think

00:14:36.506 --> 00:14:38.844
about competition and 
how you approach it?

00:14:38.844 --> 00:14:40.220
Thanks.

00:14:40.220 --> 00:14:41.604
- What's her name again, 
one more time?

00:14:41.604 --> 00:14:42.374
- [India] Sarah.

00:14:42.374 --> 00:14:43.350
- Sarah, thank you so much.

00:14:43.350 --> 00:14:45.596
I like the taxi photo 
in the background.

00:14:45.596 --> 00:14:46.904
You know, this is a tricky one.

00:14:46.904 --> 00:14:48.611
I think this comes 
down to the individual.

00:14:48.611 --> 00:14:51.261
I don't spend a lot of
time on my competition.

00:14:51.261 --> 00:14:53.785
I haven't historically.

00:14:53.785 --> 00:14:56.149
But I keep, you know, a
fifth of an eye on it.

00:14:56.149 --> 00:14:57.777
You know, you want 
to know context,

00:14:57.777 --> 00:15:00.100
you can't be blind 
to things completely

00:15:00.100 --> 00:15:02.765
but I don't dwell or allow
my competition to drive

00:15:02.765 --> 00:15:05.076
my mentality or where I'm going.

00:15:05.076 --> 00:15:06.589
I think it's a very fine line.

00:15:06.589 --> 00:15:09.226
I think it's a very, 
very fine line.

00:15:09.226 --> 00:15:11.795
And I think it's a very
individual thing so.

00:15:11.795 --> 00:15:14.199
I don't know much 
about the agency world,

00:15:14.199 --> 00:15:16.528
as a whole, I don't know the
names of most of the CEOs.

00:15:16.528 --> 00:15:18.639
I don't know how much
revenue they're doing.

00:15:18.639 --> 00:15:19.950
I don't know who 
their clients are.

00:15:19.950 --> 00:15:21.174
I don't know what 
the work they're doing.

00:15:21.174 --> 00:15:24.881
A lot of my contemporaries
spend all their time on AdAge

00:15:24.881 --> 00:15:26.922
and DigiDay and other websites

00:15:26.922 --> 00:15:28.636
to keep up with what's going on.

00:15:28.636 --> 00:15:32.130
PRWeek, AdWeek, in the trades.

00:15:32.130 --> 00:15:34.092
I think that there's a lot
of entrepreneurs that do

00:15:34.092 --> 00:15:36.614
extremely well by 
knowing what's going on

00:15:36.614 --> 00:15:38.649
with their competitors
and using that as a proxy,

00:15:38.649 --> 00:15:39.994
as a guiding light.

00:15:39.994 --> 00:15:42.110
I think a lot of entrepreneurs
are B and C entrepreneurs

00:15:42.110 --> 00:15:44.060
and they need somebody
else to be the leader

00:15:44.060 --> 00:15:45.895
and they follow it and
they pick up the crumbs.

00:15:45.895 --> 00:15:47.481
And they get 20 and 
30% of the action

00:15:47.481 --> 00:15:48.820
and that's enough for them.

00:15:48.820 --> 00:15:50.574
And that's where 
they deserve to be.

00:15:50.574 --> 00:15:54.478
I think others like me are
super driven by not knowing.

00:15:54.478 --> 00:15:56.676
I don't even want 
to give my competition

00:15:56.676 --> 00:15:59.570
the satisfaction of knowing.

00:15:59.570 --> 00:16:02.054
I mean, I literally hate
my competition so much

00:16:02.054 --> 00:16:04.135
that I literally want 
to be disrespectful

00:16:04.135 --> 00:16:06.984
by not even amassing 
a minute of my time

00:16:06.984 --> 00:16:08.656
on what they're doing
because I think

00:16:08.656 --> 00:16:11.167
that's the ultimate
insult and I like that.

00:16:11.167 --> 00:16:12.801
Because I don't 
like you, competition.

00:16:12.801 --> 00:16:14.425
I don't like you.

00:16:14.425 --> 00:16:16.448
Now, I like you 
as a human being,

00:16:16.448 --> 00:16:20.441
like in, when I put my
jersey on, I hate you,

00:16:20.441 --> 00:16:23.126
but as like a human,
there's plenty of executives

00:16:23.126 --> 00:16:25.039
from competitive 
agencies that I adore

00:16:25.039 --> 00:16:26.615
and think are 
really good people.

00:16:26.615 --> 00:16:29.783
But, when I put my 
jersey on, I hate you

00:16:29.783 --> 00:16:32.270
and the way that I can
teach you that I hate you

00:16:32.270 --> 00:16:34.917
is to not even 
allocate a minute on you

00:16:34.917 --> 00:16:37.769
because I disrespect
you that much.

00:16:37.769 --> 00:16:39.154
That's me.

00:16:39.154 --> 00:16:42.496
You may be somebody who
learns from your competitors

00:16:42.496 --> 00:16:44.006
and that's how you navigate.

00:16:44.006 --> 00:16:46.205
So, I do not think that
anybody who taught you

00:16:46.205 --> 00:16:47.962
one way or the 
other, emphatically,

00:16:47.962 --> 00:16:50.040
don't forget, #AskGaryVee Show,

00:16:50.040 --> 00:16:53.020
I'm one dude, 
with one personality trait,

00:16:53.020 --> 00:16:55.866
with, you know, one life that
is trying to communicate

00:16:55.866 --> 00:16:57.629
my points of view but I never,

00:16:57.629 --> 00:16:59.174
and I've said this on DailyVee recently,

00:16:59.174 --> 00:17:02.594
I have no interest in you 
following, you know, my footsteps.

00:17:02.594 --> 00:17:05.646
I have you, I have
interest in you trying to

00:17:05.646 --> 00:17:08.944
figure out yourself the way I
figured out myself. Right?

00:17:08.944 --> 00:17:11.925
I know that about me so
I don't force myself to

00:17:12.685 --> 00:17:14.460
look at the competition
'cause I know, deep down,

00:17:14.460 --> 00:17:16.946
it's not who I am or
what I want to be doing.

00:17:16.946 --> 00:17:18.333
And so I know that about myself.

00:17:18.333 --> 00:17:19.307
You need to know yourself.

00:17:19.307 --> 00:17:20.858
And it may be a balance.

00:17:20.858 --> 00:17:22.328
Some people are 50/50.

00:17:22.328 --> 00:17:26.383
It all works if you're
most self-aware about you.

